.turbo/cache
.turbo/cookies
**/.next
**/build
**/dist
**/node_modules
**/*.tsbuildinfo
data/
images/
packages/*/.turbo/turbo-build.log
apps/*/.turbo/turbo-build.log
**/.env*
# Tracked env files (templates, the dotenvx-encrypted prod set) stay in the
# context: turbo hashes a package's tracked files, so dropping them here would
# give the Docker build a different task hash than CI's check job and miss the
# remote cache. Plaintext env files and keys stay out.
!apps/*/.env.example
!apps/*/.env.*.example
!apps/*/.env.prod
!packages/*/.env.example
!packages/*/.env.*.example
.env.keys
